OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder of missing
OL,4,A20-year-old woman                      
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged    
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a missing           
OL,8,F20-year-old woman in Dumfries and      
OL,9,FGalloway.                              
OL,11,FKelsey Hunter was last seen in Castle  
OL,12,FDouglas at 17:00 on Saturday. A major  
OL,13,Fsearch is under way in the nearby      
OL,14,Fvillage of Springholm where she lives. 
OL,16,FDaniel McKnight, 21, has appeared on   
OL,17,Fpetition in Dumfries Sheriff Court     
OL,18,Fcharged with murder and two other      
OL,19,Fcharges, including defeating the ends  
OL,20,Fof justice.                            
